    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293-a5">

                <pb facs="0538" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg504"/>


                <head>Mr. C. N. Riotte to Mr. A. T. A. Torbert.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation,
                                Nicaragua,</hi><hi rendition="#italic"> Leon</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-02-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 26, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>S<hi rendition="#small-caps">ir</hi>: * * * I have received your note of the 21st
                    instant, and will not omit to call the attention of the Department of State to
                    the important subject therein mentioned. During the last trying six months I
                    seriously felt the absence of a national vessel, which I was unable to have sent
                    here in spite of repeated requests on my part.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. N. RIOTTE.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>These are correct copies.</p>
                </postscript>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. N. RIOTTE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
